{
  "name": "Danica",
  "notes": [
    "Written by hand from the talent descriptions and how the kit plays.",
    "Maid state: Defense Maid = Elemental Burst used off-field with full Excitement; Battle Maid = on-field with full Excitement.",
    "Defense Maid: party ATK + ATK Bonus Ratio x Danica's ATK (before this buff), up to Max ATK Bonus (500 at Burst Lv10). C1 multiplies both by 1.8 (900 at Lv10).",
    "Battle Maid: On-Field E2 Stellar-Conduct DMG + On-Field E2 DMG Increase (70.27% at Lv10), x2.2 at C1 (154.6%).",
    "A4: Defense Maid ATK +20% per stack, Battle Maid ATK SPD +20% per stack, up to 3 stacks.",
    "P3: Base Stellar-Conduct DMG +0.7% per 100 ATK, up to 14%.",
    "C2 Toast: other members' Stellar-Conduct DMG + 100% of Danica's ATK (Danica herself in Defense Maid). In Battle Maid, Danica consumes all her stacks: +150% ATK each, up to 7 (1050%).",
    "C6: party Stellar-Conduct DMG +20%; Defense Maid: active character +10% per 1000 ATK (max 40%); Battle Maid: On-Field E2 CRIT Rate +2.5% / CRIT DMG +25% per 500 ATK (max 10% / 100%).",
    "Not included: Energy restoration (Battle Maid, C1, C4), C4 shield in Battle Maid, A4 extra Excited points."
  ],
